<Site title="Privacy — MooonStoreClinic"><section class="wrap prose section"><p class="eyebrow">UPDATED 21 SEPTEMBER 2026</p><h1>Privacy, plainly.</h1><p>This website introduces the independent MooonStoreClinic service. It has no enquiry submission backend, account system, payment collection or visitor file upload.</p><h2>Website requests</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts the site and processes technical request data to deliver and protect it. Operational logs may include IP addresses, requested URLs and errors. This site does not add advertising trackers or analytics cookies. Hosting infrastructure may use security mechanisms.</p><h2>When you contact us</h2><p>Email or WhatsApp communications are handled through those providers. We use information you provide to respond, scope work and manage an agreed engagement. Please avoid sharing customer exports, credentials or payment data. Access and data handling for implementation are agreed separately.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can request correction or deletion of enquiry information through the same channel you used to contact Mooon. Necessary transaction records may need to be retained for applicable obligations. This page will be updated before adding forms, analytics or other data collection.</p><a href="/contact/">Contact options →</a></section></Site>